ng that Pokémon.)SVIRare Candy SVI’Choose 1 of your Basic Pokemon in play. If you have a Stage 2 card in your hand that evolves from that Pokemon, put that card onto the Basic Pokemon to evolve it. You can't use this card during your first turn or on a Basic Pokemon that was put into play this turn.(pokemonCatcherErrataEPOPokémon Catcher&Pokemon Catcher EPOŒSwitch your opponent's Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.&Pokemon Catcher SVIºFlip a coin. If heads, switch 1 of your opponent's Benched Pokemon with their Active Pokemon.Quick BallCrushing HammerEnergy SearchEnergy SwitchExp. Share
